1. A display device comprising:  
a display panel;  
a backlight substrate disposed behind the display panel and having a front-facing surface facing the display panel;  
a plurality of light emitters mounted at respective mounting regions of the front-facing surface;  
a reflection sheet covering the front-facing surface except at the respective mounting regions;  
a plurality of drivers electrically coupled to the plurality of light emitters; and  
a plurality of partition-wall structures corresponding respectively to the plurality of drivers, each partition-wall structure surrounding and enclosing a corresponding one of the plurality of drivers.
